{"id":"familial","lemma":"familial","pos":"adj","rank":3096,"glosses":["family; familial"],"ipa":"/fa.mi.ljal/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/7/72/Fr-familial.ogg/Fr-familial.ogg.mp3","forms":{"feminine":"familiale","masculinePlural":"familiaux","femininePlural":"familiales"},"formAudio":{"familiale":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/38/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-familiale.wav","familiaux":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5f/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Lyoko%C3%AF-familiaux.wav","familiales":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/5a/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-Poslovitch-familiales.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"C'est un secret familial.","en":"It's a family secret.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"secret"},null]},{"text":"J'ai eu une urgence familiale.","en":"I had a family emergency.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"to have","l":"avoir"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"emergency, urgency"},null]},{"text":"C'est une tradition familiale.","en":"It's a family tradition.","words":[{"g":"it / that"},{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"tradition"},null]},{"text":"Elle parlait encore et encore de ses problèmes familiaux.","en":"She talked on and on about her family problems.","words":[{"g":"she / it"},{"g":"to speak, talk","l":"parler"},null,null,null,{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"his"},{"g":"problem","l":"problème"},null],"phrases":[[2,5,"again and again"]]},{"text":"Nous devons maintenir les traditions familiales.","en":"We must keep up the family traditions.","words":[{"g":"we / us"},{"g":"must","l":"devoir"},{"g":"to maintain"},{"g":"the / them","l":"le"},{"g":"tradition","l":"tradition"},null]}]}